        {
          "id": "ai-safety-security-quality-q4",
          "number": 4,
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What do you trace and measure for an LLM system in production?",
          "points": [
            "A <strong>trace per request, span per step</strong>: retrieval, each LLM call, each tool call, guardrail decisions",
            "On each LLM span: <strong>model, prompt version, tokens, latency (TTFT), cost, finish reason</strong>",
            "Quality next to latency: <strong>sampled judge scores</strong>, user signals, escalation rate",
            "Dashboards by <strong>tenant / task / model</strong>: cost, p95 latency, error and fallback rates",
            "Redact before export; <strong>bounded metric labels</strong>; alerts on regressions, not just errors",
            "<svg class=\"md-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1.15em\" height=\"1.15em\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.2em;flex-shrink:0\"><path d=\"m22.61 18.99-9.08-9.08c.93-2.34.45-5.1-1.44-7C9.79.61 6.21.4 3.66 2.26L7.5 6.11 6.08 7.52 2.25 3.69C.39 6.23.6 9.82 2.9 12.11c1.86 1.86 4.57 2.35 6.89 1.48l9.11 9.11c.39.39 1.02.39 1.41 0l2.3-2.3c.4-.38.4-1.01 0-1.41m-3 1.6-9.46-9.46c-.61.45-1.29.72-2 .82-1.36.2-2.79-.21-3.83-1.25C3.37 9.76 2.93 8.5 3 7.26l3.09 3.09 4.24-4.24-3.09-3.09c1.24-.07 2.49.37 3.44 1.31 1.08 1.08 1.49 2.57 1.24 3.96-.12.71-.42 1.37-.88 1.96l9.45 9.45z\"></path></svg> <strong>ResoDesk:</strong> OTel traces to Langfuse, usage event per LLM call, Grafana metrics, p95 800 ms latency gate; judge scores on traces is C-18"
